#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:179
msgid ""
"Maxim's microcontrollers provide low-power, efficient, and secure solutions "
"for challenging embedded applications. Maxim's processors embed cutting-edge "
"technologies to secure data and intellectual property, proven analog "
"circuitry for real-world applications, and battery-conserving low power "
"operation."
msgstr ""

