"The nRF52 Series are built for speed to carry out increasingly complex tasks "
"in the shortest possible time and return to sleep, conserving precious "
"battery power. They have a Cortex-M4F processor which makes them quite "
"capable Bluetooth Smart SoCs."
msgstr ""

