msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:191
msgid ""
"The NXP LPC is a family of 32-bit microcontroller integrated circuits by NXP "
"Semiconductors. The LPC chips are grouped into related series that are based "
"around the same 32-bit ARM processor core, such as the Cortex-M4F, Cortex-"
"M3, Cortex-M0+, or Cortex-M0. Internally, each microcontroller consists of "
"the processor core, static RAM memory, flash memory, debugging interface, "
"and various peripherals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:193 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:2552
msgid ":ref:`platform_openhw`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:194
msgid ""
"OpenHW Group is a not-for-profit, global organization that provides an "
"infrastructure for hosting high quality open-source HW developments in line "
"with industry best practices. The OpenHW CV32E40P RISC-V core is the first "
"open-source core for high-volume chips verified with the state-of-the-art "
"process required for high-integrity, commercial SoCs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:196 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:1607
#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:5688
msgid ":ref:`platform_raspberrypi`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:197
msgid ""
"RP2040 is a low-cost, high-performance microcontroller device with a large "
"on-chip memory, symmetric dual-core processor complex, and rich peripheral."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:199 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:1600
#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:1649 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:1733
#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:1740
