msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:200
msgid ""
"Renesas Advanced (RA) 32-bit microcontrollers with the Arm Cortex-M33, -M23 "
"and -M4 processor cores deliver key advantages compared to competitive Arm "
"Cortex-M MCUs by providing stronger embedded security, superior CoreMark "
"performance and ultra-low power operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:202 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:3798
msgid ":ref:`platform_riscv_gap`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:203
msgid ""
"GreenWaves GAP8 IoT application processor enables the cost-effective "
"development, deployment and autonomous operation of intelligent sensing "
"devices that capture, analyze, classify and act on the fusion of rich data "
"sources such as images, sounds or vibrations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:205 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:8754
#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:8761 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:8775
#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:8782 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:8789
msgid ":ref:`platform_shakti`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:206
msgid ""
"Shakti is an open-source initiative by the RISE group at IIT-Madras, which "
"is not only building open source, production grade processors, but also "
"associated components like interconnect fabrics, verification tools, storage "
"controllers, peripheral IPs and SOC tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:208 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:7186
#: ../../../plus/debugging.rst:7193 ../../../plus/debugging.rst:7200
